ui/gtk: ASoftware's look: logo, window icon, a dark side bar

The window icon is asoftware.png next to the executable (ASoftware's
logo; the QEMU icon when it is missing). With sidebar=on the side bar
gets its own dark style (rounded buttons, Install .ipa as the accent,
Shut down red under the pointer), the logo and name at its top, and GTK
prefers its dark theme for menus and dialogs. The Screen off cover (0007)
shows the logo too.
Based on QEMU v11.1.2 with 0002-0007.

